        <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          Tekton sells sockets, wrenches and ratchets mostly online, at prices well below the tool trucks, with a warranty that covers nearly everything. Here is how that holds up for home mechanics and pros.
